      "Way 1: add the first two first: 1/3 + 3/5.",
      "LCM of 3 and 5 is 15: 1/3 = (1 × 5)/(3 × 5) = 5/15 and 3/5 = (3 × 3)/(5 × 3) = 9/15.",
