      "Now 14/15 + 7/6. LCM of 15 and 6 is 30: 14/15 = (14 × 2)/(15 × 2) = 28/30 and 7/6 = (7 × 5)/(6 × 5) = 35/30.",
      "28/30 + 35/30 = 63/30.",
      "Way 2: add the last two first: 3/5 + 7/6. LCM 30: (3 × 6)/(5 × 6) = 18/30 and (7 × 5)/(6 × 5) = 35/30, so 53/30.",
      "Now 1/3 + 53/30. 1/3 = (1 × 10)/(3 × 10) = 10/30. 10/30 + 53/30 = 63/30.",
      "Both ways give 63/30. Divide top and bottom by 3 (their GCF): 63/30 = 21/10."
     ],
